\# GCE Database Rules

\#\# Purpose

This rule governs every database implementation across the GCE platform.

Whenever creating or modifying:

\- Tables  
\- Relationships  
\- SQL  
\- Supabase  
\- RLS Policies  
\- Triggers  
\- Views  
\- Functions  
\- Migrations  
\- Database Queries

always follow the official database documentation before writing code.

\---

